      "common:synonyms": [
        {
          "#text": "切削液；金属加工液；切削冷却润滑液",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        },
        {
          "#text": "cutting fluid; metalworking fluid; cutting coolant and lubricant",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        }
      ],
      "common:shortName": [],
      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "Cutting fluid is a type of coolant and lubricant designed specifically for metalworking processes, such as machining and stamping. It includes oils, oil-water emulsions, pastes, gels, aerosols, and air or other gases. It is used in the metalworking process like cutting, drilling, milling, turning to reduce the heat produced due to the deformation and machining process to lubricate for reducing friction and wear and tear on the workpiece. These fluids are typically produced by a simple process of mixing water and mineral oils, fatty oils, and vegetable oils, with an emulsifier.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "切削液是一种专为金属加工过程（如机械加工和冲压）设计的冷却剂和润滑剂。它包括油、油水乳化液、膏、凝胶、气雾剂以及空气或其他气体。在金属加工过程中，如切削、钻孔、铣削、车削等，使用切削液可以减少由于变形和机械加工过程产生的热量，润滑以减少摩擦和工件的磨损。这些液体通常通过简单的混合水和矿物油、脂肪油、植物油以及乳化剂的过程来生产。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
      ],
